e single “How You Like That” from their fandom (nicknamed Blink) created waves across social media and YouTube, with the solo teaser videos for ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.youtube.com\u002Fwatch?v=cVz8UQznK-U","isExternal":false},"Jisoo"],", ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.youtube.com\u002Fwatch?v=ZkbNDErPFko","isExternal":false},"Jennie"],", ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.youtube.com\u002Fwatch?v=RbHXthF3GSU","isExternal":false},"Rosé"]," and ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.youtube.com\u002Fwatch?v=i8hicLO6gwY","isExternal":false},"Lisa"]," accumulating over 65 million views."],["inline-embed",{"props":{"contentType":"article","contributors":{"author":{"items":[{"name":"Taylor Glasby","url":"\u002Fprofile\u002Ftaylor-glasby"}]}},"dangerousDek":"","dangerousHed":"How Blackpink Became The Biggest K-Pop Girl Band On The Planet\u0011","id":"5ebc196b7bbee730114001a9","image":{"altText":"Image may contain: Shorts, Clothing, Apparel, Human, Person, Footwear, and Shoe","sources":{"sm":{"aspectRatio":"1:1","width":640,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_640,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg","srcset":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_120,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 120w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_240,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 240w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_320,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 320w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_640,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 640w"},"md":{"aspectRatio":"1:1","width":768,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_768,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg","srcset":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_120,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 120w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_240,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 240w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_320,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 320w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_640,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 640w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_768,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 768w"},"lg":{"aspectRatio":"1:1","width":768,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_768,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg","srcset":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_120,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 120w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_240,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 240w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_320,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 320w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_640,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 640w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_768,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 768w"},"xl":{"aspectRatio":"1:1","width":775,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_775,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg","srcset":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_120,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 120w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_240,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 240w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_320,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 320w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_640,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 640w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_768,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 768w"},"xxl":{"aspectRatio":"1:1","width":775,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_775,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg","srcset":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_120,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 120w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_240,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 240w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_320,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 320w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_640,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 640w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.vogue.co.uk\u002Fphotos\u002F5ebc196b7bbee730114001a8\u002F1:1\u002Fw_768,c_limit\u002FLEAD-BLACKPINK-Vogue-12may20-PR.jpg 768w"}},"modelName":"photo"},"rubric":{"name":"Music"},"showButton":false,"url":"\u002Fmiss-vogue\u002Farticle\u002Fblackpink-biggest-k-pop-girl-band","hasWhiteBg":false,"position":4},"level":"block","ref":"5ebc196b7bbee730114001a9","type":"article"}],["p","With a second single reportedly dropping in August followed by their first full-length album in September, a new ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.youtube.com\u002Fwatch?v=ZjGiK87EaQ0","isExternal":false},"reality series"],", a recent successful collaboration with Lady Gaga on “",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.youtube.com\u002Fwatch?v=Fc2qWBIToKU","isExternal":false},["em","Sour Candy"]],"”, a cute new line of ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.teenvogue.com\u002Fstory\u002Fblackpink-talks-new-jazwares-doll-collection-inspired-by-music-videos","isExternal":false},"collectible dolls"],", and Rosé announcing that she’s become the latest Saint Laurent global ambassador, Blackpink appears to be voraciously making up for their hiatus as a group."],["cm-unit"],["p","Blackpink are known for their maximalist visual style, which has been mirrored sonically on their biggest hits “Kill This Love” and “Ddu-du-ddu-du”. With “How You Like That”, the members tell ",["em","Miss Vogue"]," they’ve sought out “a new and more sophisticated look both musically and visually,” while the energy and power that brought them legions of fans is as vital and present as ever."],["inline-embed",{"type":"cneinterlude","props":{"brand":"vogue-uk","embeddedVideos":["60c2ac147c16658301d89d44"],"hasExcludedEmbed":false,"playerBase":"https:\u002F\u002Fplayer.cnevids.com","isRailEligible":false,"isRightRail":false,"relatedVideo":{"showRelatedVideo":false,"brand":"vogue-uk","related":{"__typename":"Gallery","id":"5ed0db358b4f53a8714e4485","hed":"11 Of Blackpink’s Best Fashion Week Looks To Date","promoHed":"11 Of Blackpink’s Best Fashion Week Looks To Date","url":"miss-vogue\u002Fgallery\u002Fblackpink-fashion-week-moments","rubric":"Miss Vogue","pubDate":"2020-09-17T11:20:00.000Z","metadata":{"contentType":"gallery"},"channel":{"name":"Miss Vogue","slug":"miss-vogue"},"contentWarnings":[],"allContributors":{"edges":[{"node":{"name":"Naomi Pike","url":"profile\u002Fnaomi-pike","type":"AUTHOR"}}]},"tout":{"__typename":"Photo","id":